The '''PYRAMID30 Okaiken''' is a chart that ranks the best-performing singles in [[Okaiken]]. Its data, published by Nikkan Sports & Entertainment magazine, KTK Group and compiled by Okaiken Pyramid Records, is based collectively on each single's weekly physical and digital sales, as well as radio airplay and streaming. PYRAMID30 Okaiken is a subsidiary of Pyramid Records but acts as a separate organization. The weekly charts are updated every Sunday at 11:45 in the morning (UTC +9). The following lists all of the number one singles of the PYRAMID30 Okaiken for 2023.

2023 is historically noted as the "Year of the Subwoofers" in Okaiken music history. While anime themes continued to perform well globally, the domestic charts were radically shifted by the peak of the "Okaiken Drill" movement. Hip-hop artists like [[Watson (rapper)|Watson]], [[BAD HOP]], and [[Awich]] dethroned traditional pop acts, while a concurrent "Punk Revival" saw veteran bands like [[10-FEET]] and [[ELLEGARDEN]] returning to the number one spot for the first time in decades.

